Z||000000||onfire||12-28-2000||02:29 AM||||Just thought I would post a pic. of my friend and his Fiero. Since I don't have one yet. Its an 86 SE 4cyl. automatic. With American Racing Pinzetti 17x7 wheels. Tires are 215 40 or 45 series can't remember. The ugly bra is on there because it has some light front end damage. Which he hopes to fix in the next few months. He's also planning a v8 swap in the next year or so. I tried to get him on the forum, but he's not into computers that much. He lets me drive it every now and again, to get my Fiero fix. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR> <IMG SRC="http://homestead.deja.com/user.on_fire/files/86FIERO.JPG"> <P>------------------<BR>"I seen it on the internet, and I believe everthing on the net."<BR><A HREF="http://homestead.deja.com/user.on_fire/on_fire.html" TARGET=_blank>Check out my waist of banbwidth.</A>||||reg||1
