Z||000006||onfire||12-31-2000||03:45 AM||||Thanks. His name is Wili. The front end has a big rip in it. So it needs the bra.<P>I myself am looking for 85 GT again v6 4speed, or an 86-87 SE v6 5speed. It has to have a v6 or a v8  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> with a manual tranny. The first thing I would do is get wheels for it. Then some body mods, so it  can be any color. And the paint don't have to be great.It just has to run and drive very good. With no body or frame damage.||||reg||1
